options.description:
If 'Abnormality Page Shuffle' option is set to 'Sets' or 'Pages', forces certain Abno Pages to be on the same floor after randomization:
'Hate', 'Despair', 'Greed', 'Wrath', 'Nix';
'Big Eyes', 'Small Beak', 'Long Arms', 'The Beast';
'Baptism', 'Apostles', 'Advent'.

!!! IMPORTANT: If 'Abnormality Page Shuffle' is set to 'Sets', one of the floors will be forced to have exact same pool of Abno Pages as vanilla Tiphereth floor.

Gurglevale progression items rework.
false: vanilla
true: Dirty Key is required to open the door between Graveyard Basin and Gurgling Gorge;
The door that connects Tyrant’s Ravine and Gurgling Gorge can now be opened from the Gurgling Gorge side only;
This means that either Gurgling Tower Key or Dirty Key are required to reach Cockatrice and proceed with the game;
Kitchen Key is now needed to open Gnoddrick’s arena door.

