A list of items required in logic to beat Sigma
Rising Fire is already required by default
for example: { Ground Hunter: 1, Soul Body: 1, Lightning Web: 1, Heart Tank: 8 }

Which CPU will be your main opponent?
(This CPU will get things like points from deathlink, points
from Coins Trap, etc)

No Shadow Pokemon is a legendary. With "Randomize Shadow Species" on, Shadows are never randomized into one;
with it off, the vanilla legendary Shadows (Shadow Lugia and the three birds) become random non-legendary
Pokemon instead. Shadow Lugia is the one exception when "Shuffle Shadow Lugia" is on.

The weapon energy refills placed in the world (25)
count as checks: the first pickup of each one sends its location;
afterwards they keep respawning.

Include locations for pecking the model church apart
first_pecks_only - includes two locations; 
all_pecks - includes all 35 pecks each as their own location

The postions of levels when Spawn Randomizer is on.
Structured {"Level" : "Original Door"}
Example [{"Atl1" : "FoF!"}, {"Atl?" : "Otw?"}]

Makes difficult levels expect the player to have certain amount of powerups in order to beat them

Easy: Hard levels require Mushroom + (Item box or Midway Points);
      Harder levels require Fire Flower + (Extra Defense or Item box or Midway Points)
Medium: Hard levels require Mushroom;
        Harder levels require Mushroom + (Item box or Midway Points)
Hard: No powerups or other items are required in any level to be beaten

