When Death Link is enabled, add a permanent Death Fragment curse after receiving a Death Link
while in a run, provided the character survives the configured damage. If received during combat,
another copy is also added to that combat's draw pile.

If a story quest has multiple routes you can take depending on your decisions;
Any: Any decision made will send the check for that story quest.
All: Every individual decision will send it's own check, potentially requiring you to play the same scenario multiple times.

NOTE: This does nothing if you didn't select Open Mode.
Determines what you need to save Woody. Options:
Pizza Planet Tokens; Defeated Bosses; Level Unlock;
Pizza Planet Tokens & Defeated Bosses;
Pizza Planet Tokens & Level Unlock;
Defeated Bosses & Level Unlock;
Pizza Planet Tokens, Defeated Bosses, & Level Unlock.

Add the Marsh Pass item to the game. The Marsh pass gives free access to the Great Marsh,
but if it is enabled, it is required to enter. (i.e., you cannot pay to enter the Great Marsh
if this option is enabled)

Random draws the requested number of starting cards. One Stock Card
per Class starts with nine stock-loadout cards, one for each mercenary;
the random starting count is ignored. Rarity and form still roll normally.

With Treesanity, the amount of tree checks per fruit 
(3 makes 15, or one tree per type). A tree drops 3 at most per harvest;
it bears again 3 days after shaking.

If enabled, you may have to obtain sing bulb without the normal requirement by singing
from far away. The bulb that can be obtained that way are:
Naija's Home, bulb after the energy door;
The Veil bottom area, bulb in the spirit path
